      ],
      "description": "<p>The mist bear Strides twice. During this movement, wisps of ethereal smoke trail from its body, making it Concealed. The mist bear then Strikes. The target is Off-Guard to this attack if the bear moved at least 20 feet.</p>",
      "collapsed": false
