      "traits": [
        "concentrate",
        "occult",
        "polymorph"
      ],
      "description": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> The mist bear has a creature Grabbed</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The mist bear digs its claws into the grabbed creature as it dissipates into mist. The grabbed creature takes 3d8 Slashing Damage damage (Basic DC 25 Fortitude Saving Throw save). The mist bear gains the benefits of its Mist Form, Flies up to 10 feet, and then returns to its solid form.</p>",
